#: ../../api/types/chat_permissions.rst:3
msgid "ChatPermissions"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions:1 of
msgid ""
"Describes actions that a non-administrator user is allowed to take in a "
"chat."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#chatpermissions"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_messages:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send text messages, "
"rich messages, contacts, giveaways, giveaway winners, invoices, locations"
" and venues"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может отправлять "
"текстовые и форматированные (rich) сообщения, контакты, розыгрыши, "
"победителей розыгрышей, счета, геолокации и места"

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_audios:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send audios"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_documents:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send documents"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_photos:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send photos"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_videos:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send videos"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_video_notes:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send video notes"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_voice_notes:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send voice notes"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_polls:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send polls and "
"checklists"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_send_other_messages:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to send animations, "
"games, stickers, widgets and use inline bots"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может отправлять "
"анимации, игры, стикеры, виджеты и пользоваться inline-ботами"

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_add_web_page_previews:1
#: of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to add web page previews"
" to their messages"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_react_to_messages:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to react to messages. If"
" omitted, defaults to the value of *can_send_messages*."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может ставить реакции на"
" сообщения. Если не задано, используется значение *can_send_messages*."

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_edit_tag:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to edit their own tag. "
"If omitted, defaults to the value of *can_pin_messages*."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может изменять свой тег."
" Если не задано, используется значение *can_pin_messages*."

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_change_info:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to change the chat "
"title, photo and other settings. Ignored in public supergroups."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может изменять название "
"чата, фотографию и другие настройки. Игнорируется в публичных "
"супергруппах."

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_invite_users:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to invite new users to "
"the chat"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_pin_messages:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to pin messages. Ignored"
" in public supergroups."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может закреплять "
"сообщения. Игнорируется в публичных супергруппах."

#: litegram.types.chat_permissions.ChatPermissions.can_manage_topics:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. :code:`True`, if the user is allowed to create forum topics. "
"If omitted, defaults to the value of can_pin_messages."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. :code:`True`, если пользователь может создавать темы "
"форума. Если не задано, используется значение can_pin_messages."

